usage: agent.py [-h] --task TASK --repo REPO --model MODEL [--auto]
                [--context-mode {evidence,upstream}]
                [--profile {auto,basic,generic,source,paper}]
                [--allow ALLOW [ALLOW ...]] [--config CONFIG]

CLI and run artifacts; all autonomous decisions execute in official CodeAgent.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --task TASK
  --repo REPO
  --model MODEL
  --auto
  --context-mode {evidence,upstream}
  --profile {auto,basic,generic,source,paper}
  --allow ALLOW [ALLOW ...]
  --config CONFIG
